  "manual_rebase_notes": [
    "仅几何预检按EN整句锚合人工候选：For example, if the first language is English and the target language is Korean, a second-language learner might position the Korean verb between the subject and the object of the sentence, using the English word order, rather than placing the verb after the object, which is the correct Korean word order.",
    "仅几何预检按EN整句锚合人工候选：What’s more, second language learning can even be characterized as a gradual shift from the first language orientation to the target language orientation."
  ],
